ANNEX C – DATA PROCESSING ADDENDUM (DPA) (EN)
DATA PROCESSING ADDENDUM (DPA)

This Data Processing Addendum forms part of the SaaS License Agreement.

C1. Roles

Customer: Data Controller

Company: Data Processor

C2. Processing Scope

The Company processes personal data solely to provide the Service.

C3. Security Measures

Appropriate technical and organizational measures are implemented to protect personal data.

C4. Subprocessors

The Company may use subprocessors for hosting and infrastructure.

C5. Data Breach

The Company shall notify Customer without undue delay upon becoming aware of a data breach.

C6. Data Deletion

Upon termination, Customer data will be deleted within a reasonable timeframe unless legally required to retain it.
